        "text": "So x² − 11x + 24 = (x − 3)(x − 8).\n\nFor the product to be zero, x = 3 or x = 8. Both could be ages. If a question asks for the smaller root, choose 3. Check: 3² − 11 × 3 + 24 = 0.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_7"
        }
      ]
    },
